Support diagnostics (compact controls)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  n = 106139   M = 3   N_m = 913 9649 1331   N_* = 913
  d_[Delta] = 11679 (exact)   d/n = 0.1100   connected: no
  proportional cell frequencies: no  (max deviation .993)
